player->PositionCell 417 -230 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask Brallion's Ring
choose 3
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TG_SS_GreedySlaver >= 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
